<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14298" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποχέω</span></b> , imper. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόχει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.53
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπέχεα,</span>
			
				Ep.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έχευα</span>:— <i>pour
			out</i> or <i>off, spill, shed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ δ᾽ εἴδατα χεῦεν ἔραζε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					22.20
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				85
			</span></i>: poet. pres.
			
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παγὰν ἃν ἀποχεύονται Κασταλίας δῖναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					148
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pour off,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ulc.</u>
				12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.53
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be poured off,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				34.9.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ μὲν ἀποχεομένου ὕδατος, τοῦ δὲ
					ἐπιχεομένου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.76
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be shed, fall off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποχυθέντα φύλλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.332b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of plants,
				<i>come into ear,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.8.1
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ εἰς στάχυν ἀλλ᾽ οἷον
				φόβην</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.4.10
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>make to shoot,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ.ποίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					569
				</span></i>
			(s.v.l.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίτην</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				658
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
